; Natural NLC artifact classes adapted to the current CoP/IX-Ray balance.
; Scope is deliberately limited to artifact definitions and inventory visuals:
; anomaly pools, spawn chances and world population are handled separately.
;
; Existing CoP artifacts keep their original section and world visual. Only the
; NLC inventory icon, class, weight, economy and adapted belt effects are patched.
; Seven artifacts absent from CoP are defined below with their NLC world assets.
;
; Economy: classes I/II/III/IV cost 5 000/8 000/12 000/10 000 RU. Class IV
; is valuable primarily as a cooking base and remains below the first cooked
; modificat (18 000 RU). All four natural classes use technical af_rank 1 so
; the Echo engine gate can detect them; gameplay class is defined by the
; spawn/detector registries and localized descriptions.

